        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,40px);margin-bottom:20px">I've lived on both sides:<br>the data and the daily grind.</h2>
        <p>I'm a Computer Science graduate from Karachi who went straight into the engine room of e-commerce — analysing sales data, managing listings across Amazon, eBay and Shopify, and turning messy numbers into decisions with Power BI, Python and SQL. I saw first-hand how much time businesses lose to manual work. <strong>The tools they needed didn't exist — so I started building them.</strong></p>
        <p>My analytics app for e-commerce sellers came first, then management systems for retail stores and restaurants. Each one taught me the same lesson: <strong>my purpose is helping businesses become more efficient with AI, apps and digital services</strong> — built by someone who understands both the code and the business behind it.</p>
