        </div>
        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="tl"><i></i><div><h3>BS Computer Science — PAF-KIET</h3><p>Graduated in 2024 with a specialisation in Database Management Systems, alongside professional training in Power BI and design.</p></div></div>
          <div class="tl"><i></i><div><h3>Sales Analyst &amp; eCommerce Specialist — VLEAD</h3><p>Deep in real business data: sales analysis, multi-platform listings on Amazon, eBay and Shopify, and insights that drove measurable growth.</p></div></div>
          <div class="tl"><i></i><div><h3>From analysis to building</h3><p>Built a full analytics app for e-commerce sellers, then management systems for retail stores and restaurants — real tools for real operations.</p></div></div>
          <div class="tl"><i></i><div><h3>Today</h3><p>Building AI-powered automations and custom apps that give business owners their time back.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
