          <h3>Analytics App for E-commerce</h3>
          <p>A complete sales intelligence dashboard for online sellers. Upload your marketplace reports and instantly see sales trends, inventory health, advertising performance and returns — across multiple countries, in one view.</p>
          <div class="chips"><span class="chip">Multi-country sales</span><span class="chip">Inventory tracking</span><span class="chip">Ads performance</span><span class="chip">Returns analysis</span><span class="chip">No backend needed</span></div>
